      "text": "1. 解决什么问题",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 解决什么问题",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0031",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 488.1,
      "width": 1394.5,
      "height": 92.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 684561670,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1825831334,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 多轮长对话中用户个人事实与偏好分散，且原话含代词指代与相对时间表达，脱离上下文后无法独立理解；\n2. 用户偏好或状态变更后，新旧记忆并存导致检索结果前后矛盾。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 多轮长对话中用户个人事实与偏好分散，且原话含代词指代与相对时间表达，脱离上下文后无法独立理解；\n2. 用户偏好或状态变更后，新旧记忆并存导致检索结果前后矛盾。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
