      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. 存储形式与底层索引",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. 存储形式与底层索引",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0040",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 1394.1,
      "width": 1242.2,
      "height": 92.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1105654384,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1585057583,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 基础版 Mem0：关系数据库 / 向量数据库（HNSW 近似最近邻索引 + 余弦相似度）；\n• 图谱版 Mem0g：图数据库 Neo4j（原生 HNSW 向量索引 + 有向标记属性图 G = (V, E, L)）。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 基础版 Mem0：关系数据库 / 向量数据库（HNSW 近似最近邻索引 + 余弦相似度）；\n• 图谱版 Mem0g：图数据库 Neo4j（原生 HNSW 向量索引 + 有向标记属性图 G = (V, E, L)）。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
